# the drop-in effects: the black keys while held; FX, the FX pages, the white keys all sixteen on each; REC held, the
# same for as long; FX again the next FX page, then Space; HOME twice the Mixer; ARP twice Lead 2; GLO twice the MIDI page
intro off
wait 1000
key b0 down
wait 100
expect fx 1
key b9 down
wait 100
expect fx 0x1001
key b0 up
key b9 up
wait 100
expect fx 0
# the white keys play the lead, not effects
key w5 down
wait 100
expect fx 0
expect leadstep 5
key w5 up
# FX: the FX pages, each with the effects grid on the white keys: Bass FX first; white key 7 is Sweep (bit 6),
# white key 16 Roll
tap FX
wait 100
expect view 8
key w6 down
key w15 down
wait 300
expect fx 0x8040
shot grid.png
key w6 up
key w15 up
wait 100
expect fx 0
# each instrument's FX page: Echo, Reverb, Time, Feedback (Time and Feedback the one echo's, the same on each); then
# Space, then Bass FX again. The grid on each
spin K2 5
expect par36 55
spin K3 1
expect par21 1
shot bassfx.png
tap FX
expect view 9
spin K1 10
expect par37 10
expect par21 1
key w8 down
wait 200
expect fx 0x100
key w8 up
wait 100
shot padfx.png
tap FX
expect view 10
tap FX
expect view 11
turn K1 -1
expect par39 59
shot drumsfx.png
tap FX
expect view 12
expect par21 1
key w0 down
wait 200
expect fx 1
key w0 up
wait 100
expect fx 0
tap FX
expect view 8
tap SEL
expect view 8
# from another page, FX: Bass FX; the white keys the lead again on the others
tap LFO
key w5 down
wait 100
expect fx 0
key w5 up
tap FX
expect view 8
tap HOME
expect view 0
# HOME again: the Mixer, each instrument's level (the same as its own page's KNOB 1); again: the Song page
tap HOME
expect view 1
turn K4 1
expect par16 71
turn K2 -1
expect par12 44
shot mixer.png
tap HOME
expect view 0
tap SEQ
expect par16 71
# ENV, ENV: Bass 2, the voice (Analog, FM) and the FM's ratio, depth and decay; ENV again: the Bass page
tap ENV
tap ENV
expect view 3
turn K1 1
expect par41 1
turn K2 1
expect par42 2
shot bass2.png
tap ENV
expect view 2
# REC held: the grid while held; a key held keeps its effect after REC is let go; a tap of REC still holds
press REC
wait 500
key w3 down
wait 200
expect fx 8
shot recgrid.png
release REC
wait 100
expect held 0
expect fx 8
key w3 up
wait 100
expect fx 0
tap REC
wait 100
expect held 1
tap REC
# ARP, ARP: Lead 2; its first knob the lead's echo
tap ARP
expect view 4
tap ARP
expect view 5
spin K1 10
expect par30 50
shot leadfx.png
tap ARP
expect view 4
# GLO, GLO: the MIDI page; Channels to 4, 5, 6, 11
tap GLO
tap GLO
expect view 14
spin K2 1
expect par33 1
shot midi.png
wav fx.wav
tap HOME
key b5 down
wait 3000
key b5 up
key b7 down
wait 2000
key b7 up
wait 2000
wavstop
expect peak_db_max -0.5
